        <comment xml:lang="en">Full flow name: Aircraft, long haul
(2,4,1,3,1,5,BU:3); Calculated based on the assumed numbers of LTOs in the life time of an aircraft of 25000LTO/airplane, an average load of 251 passengers or 12 tons of freight  and an average distance of a flight of 7850km;  For the effort of the maintenance 5% of the production is added; FAA (2010) Aging Airplane Program;  Lufthansa Balance 2015

